{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1224,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55768c4929263da7123b5f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我又拍到有趣的照片了！\r\n我最喜欢的是铃鹿这张……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c71f9108eb7cd136b19485be3e92d9dbfdf82de6a79019659671ee5b75d92b02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a182c3c6fbb708436a157287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个手环是美国的朋友\r\n送我的饯别礼！只要看着它……\r\n勇气就会不断地涌出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd14f15c747d9b94e6c9be9c405d00b7a125c88ce5d9ecda8be865afe77ae15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4536c9007ac8ae5df7cc651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "It's a Training Time！\r\n我要Wild的狂奔哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1fc606ef210a1a70c45bae7b1696038e4fb19de7d953cf6dbbe53bf0f41523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f47d1322301b606262e9a3e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レッツゴー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "503c9a6175732bd7c6c4ebd2da966ab9ef4985c51ba5f95bbcb3385b5bb57b42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5615a82f246256925cd78aad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Howdy！训练员。\r\n我们要先从什么开始做起呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b90bcfeaea20b291926a0a95c81648f7cd4ed230fe38043370e8ae0756d33edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b34bb83a4660b6473d175f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在课堂中睡饱饱才来的～！\r\n也就是说呢……\r\n我已经做好训练前的准备了Death！",
      "source_fingerprint": "761624eedea5bc5df7e58220e11b290ef71b24170ded45ce1611aaffd3cad2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ace58bdee46c84ac84f2dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n麻烦你像武士道那样指导我了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b638f6ba96eb94bca059f8c201af38032158337a220a0519dc7bbdce268b71e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fa2cb350f935263b398db30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想让Family跟Friends\r\n看看我Live的样子……\r\n所以会努力接受训练的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f444aa4233eb474f5f404f76d0c308331f810402966635e3ae7170f8b9c88a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67d402f74d9f355470d0ccad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这也是为了Get到Center的位置，\r\n所以要继续跟训练员\r\n一起努力训练哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "845c6eb39c2f91c87c817fdc84f16c294052aba11c86ca8cc27d13f08df772c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f573d872355e051678adb9fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要把Happy\r\n一直传送到地平线的另一边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e7fcafee943f265a2103b88a4be652c7f01fcc1efcb91e38394697e1593531",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ab55f38b0642e626ff2e46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想要更Step Up！",
      "source_fingerprint": "955d7851ac6e73af21de83b3efcbbef0607ca7055ced8ee955ab020767b5169e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4073d31c73b0dab731f708ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情very fresh！\r\n看我展现轻快的脚步吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba5de06554206da215be2190e01b048b359b9b332b6fa032c63bb70577a009ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b22297df88e27e7cd436e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的日子，\r\n也是特别的回忆！\r\n一起拍照留念吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "81224dba5a827fc9925daf0d54887de18bebafb55883f4fb876fda0496c86e67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e340b3597e48685ed94360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要闭上眼睛就能听见！\r\n爸爸跟妈妈替我加油的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdb941b8c3ab4b003f0a2d3b42fba65c2ad2f208ab01696ce60b4655cd64454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b2603584d6876f886fd60ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是外出或训练……\r\n都要保持愉快，here we go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "73b5e37a861695c01c1207247d1f2ebfbd31b4435a7746a955d4d06f5a505333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b20732f130e276cef357d56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要和训练员在一起，\r\n内心就会暖呼呼的……\r\n像在晒太阳一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f1e2fd68a047d34ccfc173ab05a580da1faf98e6122b9ac70d1f46aa31fdeea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce9eceb3c908fd6e6058bbf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前有朋友跟我说。\r\n我和训练员拍双人合照时，\r\n笑起来最可爱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b5478fa509b93d91c536495d062a9c84f32236aa463b6648c41fd815a8cc72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7eedcb4dc1bfc464031f558",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次放春假一起去美国吧！\r\n我想带你去逛充满回忆的地方……\r\n爸爸他们一定会很高兴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8761692569b505e78c3f08c37d17197e88e8afb868417141d6988baa9c658a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060fbdfad77d811e65af9dcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes！我就是Perfect的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bec33465577e6d0a39194b0bc8966a2d54ef89486e8e228d58f609c4e654497",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9530793d32a3dbe69b3e0499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在任何国家我都不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad527e657e83c6cbc99e642dcdea1506163a023597ca3e4b19d94b0a4e6b777c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda3679a91be9b0ee43c782d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我确实找到了！\r\n只属于我的宝藏♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "92121d37bd82e59b77b89d1c2da725e0e56154dc2606ce07c73e8ce7d982c4ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8413ef8ce8076a28cc42ef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成了一场充满回忆的冒险！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e02b40f2216db19bc093e268fe4c611bd5a15db99d7076f031a94a775d46ac5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d608b29c1921a98e13caa5b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还可以跑得再更快、更快吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4755a840ea8288f9678812e0a0bc7ec95936738d4d17bc3a614034b2e3c0484b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:561298ea350697a5e0ce717a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还请看着Wonderful的我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad7e181e00e3f1073ea2ebe90e68d436fd9162f39a53b49a79f2f360f417af28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60d4d7b4f30c8319eb427a00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hi！我是大树快车！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbe7ce4d6566e9ac7b020676a05dcb0d5a99f231fdf74e17539a9d3c517fd0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e18a998e782aa0b914ed1a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "BANG！\r\n把这世界轰出一个大洞吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c7ae5d89c095fe5789eb8020d12507e3aa84315f7ded84d8e7b402869778ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ca498e3fd28e8f3fd81040",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Support就交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e254601e2bdfcc7743bc40bad3e119a20d8c59cd9e0528c56c934db4c8ca41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc2086da4e53c3932c1390b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会成为值得大家信赖的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11598ad5d7064985d1b441506409856c98b3475e016ac0239a78d199aa62d8be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e929bf900c1aabc825189d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成长茁壮♪生长期！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64da2a73dbff8b84cba46a92d4f65a3ddbb2097cac6896364a6ddb3d7c79b4e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba10d92cda31035e5f3e7a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow！发现新的大树了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "633df7b2a8a755060e612620662705a9cc2acf5208e2d7f902d9030d4a568626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea3f8663081bade150bff4fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啪嚓☆拍到笑容了！\r\nVictory也将由我收下♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e56b804dee8a01e3f7739a9423550889f5ce1f8b4685f7f2c03f9078e28f9f62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b806c4f7200ced940c6cef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是大树快车☆\r\nSay cheese♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "172f8d9d84b8bfd95d777b3ce9d640946bfeb31527d1a8b49d5c56c50775e3fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1010",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90233809db8c2ca5517a76b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "072bc1cfc92553e1583c00df8ccb4b3ecd60ff542b56a93421a2b5627a7f9692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40b31e83beae83316f838210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不屈从也不妥协，这就是我。\r\n能得到您的肯定……我不胜感激。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdec50d690e02fbe95d5f80a3c09bcd893b680246dc675a4c6d448aa8b3f28c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f86252df63757a2adcdd500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってまいります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75133557f59df29494c0938969f36c0c309236de7ceb17ecf7e6c0ce9cb5da09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d84222b1d1ff1b6cbc50bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481ece6b5ae3f39ab09cef14164dcd64ddd6f960e487ca411576688b02f8f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53669ab4ee761512904977e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以赛马娘的顶点为目标的\r\n这条道路……请务必，\r\n陪我走到尽头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "674bdbfbd2fc4448a886831a35bee36c1c5869c3a11d50f259af22355b3c6b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8e2a0701f23aa816b338a87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "独身前往那里的话，果然还是会\r\n稍稍感到惴惴不安……\r\n能够再陪我去一趟吗？游戏厅♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "675faee325592384f8a4409875b01849c8494d338c655c489a308cf35e3f4287",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e61d6c1cbee95f9f559052",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐～\r\n要不要一起玩歌牌呢？\r\n是时候让你见识一下有着歌牌段位的我的力量了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "196874094a3e81f12d53188e558f2216acee26b4b24b9f1eba0309d8f335c392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d744e3612de14a81a738be63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我喜欢的日式点心，\r\n还请您收下。\r\n除了巧克力以外的情人节礼物不也别有一番滋味吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6adbb94c08df7b9a194545828da96460c72eb1e7dcf3c405aaf376cf38dd6e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d19a848b83a0bd31ba2dbc39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要不要来点\r\n和甜味很搭的抹茶呢？\r\n就让我饱含真情地给您泡上一杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "143a054547e18b732c9fa270bc8ffe330fa6d9871920a6ccab6721b21bba4d4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2286cf9052fc033245d38a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说七夕还有在梶叶上\r\n写和歌献给星星的习俗。\r\n要一起，写上一首吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "861de079fb3f4b5a7aa6f8a25faa0313aaaa782b7c1dd61838762eda7d898db1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb3919cfed5ef721dfbcf70a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和式豆粉果子、馒头、金锷烧……\r\n南瓜其实能变成\r\n各式各样的点心哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "910711dfaf9d20064041a05a2cfead851612c2275971a8533e0b5a3ef74a15fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:645d7e61f97933ce067a2833",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我的老家每年都会在这个时候挂上灯笼，\r\n所以一到圣诞季节，\r\n家里就会变成观光胜地呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "00630f82e59be1cadff53e306d195e7aab6c9a2621fb54d7f58b64de48bc5999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e673bc23b84489112b23e9ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火鸡肉做的龙田炸鸡、日式点心蛋糕和盆栽树\r\n都已经准备好了。让我们一起\r\n悠闲地度过圣诞夜吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d788ddad50443a6e650e8323b6f2f2cb712b237127fa7f2b4e52b6caad92891d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d3f66a1175d996bc1afdb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直相信我们能赢哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f454851b84a3e745337b8dd6ed09e7dc1b8a487a8b82ee12285df674d851764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418b1ad2801b5e08852a574b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了训练员您，\r\n今年我也切实地感觉到自己在稳步前进。\r\n明年也要，更进一步……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "583e1fc8017582f7582e303ffb43cc487af39ab5df10221eb4614ddf86b6018c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33035c4f3636ea4c42a6bbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐♪\r\n为了不输给每天努力的训练员，\r\n我也会继续努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89891c805f5bd31e35292778f0a5d3c5ff81bbaf36ceaa531a29e65adaea17ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff9c5dc64b115760c2b0c23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "恭喜您又添一岁。\r\n春夏秋冬、四季更替……\r\n来年也，想要为您庆生呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2d41bdf8af619c2af0fd28d19781ebc9d1de666fa2747e33ea16f36528e102b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efe6bad7ce5c42622f0eb17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都来庆祝我的生日……\r\n真是感慨万千。\r\n不以礼还礼，可不行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e85408aca26b8a2c54015e2d0201389dae979de5c3249df49db0992daf9e976",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af663d3727769b4d8add6916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然自以为擅长日语了，\r\n但在这种时候却找不到好的表达方式……\r\n呃。能收到你的祝福……我很高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9938f6dd1d410180cdf40107ae988c805ec98e91fdfbf01477b5191596521c34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d789385fcc49918e937dd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知哦。\r\n一边喝茶一边一起确认吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8fee70974a26f6d35b85add729de2c84ac3f519f3f35c050b029308b442b3f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a55a1257180702038a0362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了呢。\r\n“打开了就会被吓一跳的玉匣”…\r\n说不定这个是吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a92eb61f71facfcd7004375f762615ee4f4b7a3954cc30f8e096c9dd24887253",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19d9fafb6042bf3a258d65d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成，辛苦了。\r\n以此为目标而不懈努力……确实是很重要的呢对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "492e27a1cc30c9f4fd3beaa5778edb3c2f61811f8ee18dcd6bebe556b0fa7386",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3203ec550ce7b752a87e8804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上就要开始了呢。\r\n您准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a20e8a9e9496acd605ebf88ea00703d82e3388c3be22a1572f41f2fb0ae1a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1603f16a56ca10ad0e7720a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了呢。悠闲地\r\n按照自己的步调前进……但心中\r\n依旧期望着胜利……一起加油吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7660c8705dfe5f44ab7f46bafc42e4e3b677be76bc1e80483b4fefc8a0d8c02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c007ce215bfe80cb395e2684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不甘心，下次一定会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdbac7e6b93d44e559f251b5517aa6098b3911ee6f7c77736bb2af104c4d9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d22e9712bab5ab330d85d76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶呀，赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0002a74d88a00e39391264853e3dc4156d8a958ec775299ae2ff1f306c809353",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f3d4fedf0a414f1eda2191",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任何时候都莫忘对比赛的热情。\r\n就算是在日常生活之中，\r\n蹄铁扣也会让我回想起这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3098c5863bd5b4d26a8be0c08941e53775a0ae270bd1aa4070cf69f63c7a6d77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e4e9f67f5e6755f3f6d0990",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗衣精的香味和平常不同……啊，\r\n其实是小鹰把辣酱溅到我身上，\r\n所以替我洗衣服赔罪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "313a283482e40fe6f1d1190a061ef80915d39698a70cbc8201823f14196a73c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5071309d96d2af1609b5633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到神社、寺庙朝圣时，我有留意\r\n要让服装配合庄严肃穆的氛围。\r\n因为我并不想破坏气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71a0cce6452b19825544c23f7ac679e919b24562ad843a51d253e5ffe75a84f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c0fa008c330d964b674cf46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦啦，是平局吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "347cca8e4aef04ce9383bfa8c7558ef007da6c30c6728fe5f763cef80f7451e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6cb5b31dcb28c353a104d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ace708ce11f8b377e32264a7390dae84cfd64bd7e0de4c8f418bc3cab67755",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada7bb3cd955286f3581fb95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不甘心，下次一定会……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdbac7e6b93d44e559f251b5517aa6098b3911ee6f7c77736bb2af104c4d9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54920caa3902c3caeaaf1858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦啦，是平局吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "347cca8e4aef04ce9383bfa8c7558ef007da6c30c6728fe5f763cef80f7451e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05a6f9dfc850957789b1a13e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6e314751c96501c80ca9d73ec8ca8af95ec92121b9e45ee782ac2472d7a7e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6025daed8e97f0247fa03e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是我们的话，能赢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb203e20f5417f569f9c1eb2bab66769a38e68ad612fedba5b0c835d4905df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6133e588dfab15e20025f905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd935a7ec8d5a93398a955217cd92ff49bf9aa0637e4aa0e516402c788a86268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d589abf1c3a0fc7618d8bc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要起舞了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11eac524acc4d371b888c39bcd9613fb0e714db91a4e5c6083169b98ede2ad4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55caf84b6b4bd1dd7493f288",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去入闸吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8adc3d98ce842bf2ec9f56290e95094b629644e83b9e05b06298910d16da0445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c0e654815b301ee129329e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0ace34bfc15d5f0c7b931c44c7863b9695e6654f6bfeeb81e86032c00d60b75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
